      "sourceTextSha256": "eaf12b52b6ac5aa7d6281e4bdeba87c1e6ec7a4ea489b7e3ee36f246008f692f",
      "text": "\nA journey from the Andean capital to the Caribbean coast, blending Colombia’s rich history with its vibrant landscapes and timeless colonial charm. Explore the cultural treasures of Bogotá and the legends of El Dorado, then continue to Cartagena, where historic streets, golden light and turquoise waters invite you to slow down and savour the Colombian Caribbean.\n\n## Hotels & prices\n\nPrices per person (USD) · English-speaking guide\n\n| Category | Bogotá, 2 nights | Cartagena, 2 nights | SGL | DBL | TRP |\n|---|---|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| 4★ | Best Western Plus 93 Park Hotel | Dann Cartagena | $ 3,480 | $ 1,883 | $ 1,863 |\n| 5★ | Bogotá Marriott Hotel | Hyatt Regency Cartagena | $ 4,100 | $ 2,312 | $ 2,158 |\n\nBreakfast basis. Hotels may be replaced by others of a similar category.\n\nRates per person for 2027. Domestic flights not included.\n\nNot included: Flight Bogotá – Cartagena\n\nDomestic and international flights are not included.\n\nProgramme and services subject to final confirmation\n",
